# Heavy binary arrays under any data/ folder are LOCAL-ONLY: kept on the working machine
# (later tasks consume them directly), never published, never deleted.
# Decision 2026-07-20 (SUPERSEDES the "delete raw data > 1 MB at FINISH" rule, which traded
# reusable results for repo weight; it also subsumes the 2026-07-02 per-file npz list that
# lived here). What stays TRACKED and readable on GitHub: the distilled summary .json / .csv
# / .txt beside them (the artifacts the docs actually link, 276 references vs 16 to arrays),
# the plots, the scripts, and the per-folder _DATASETS.md manifest that indexes every
# local-only file with its producing script and the record holding its regen command.
# Regenerate a manifest with:
#   python3 dev_docs/utils/gen_datasets_manifest.py <path/to/data> --write
# Untracked going forward; existing copies remain in pre-existing history (no rewrite).
**/data/*.npz
**/data/**/*.npz
# M5.32: local-only reproduction copies of record JSONs and run logs (the comparison lives in m5_32_r0_baseline.json)
openwave/xperiments/m5_liquid_crystal/research/data/m5_32_r0_b/
openwave/xperiments/m5_liquid_crystal/research/data/m5_32_*_log*.txt
**/data/*.npy
**/data/*.npz.bak
**/data/*.h5
**/data/*.hdf5
**/data/*.pkl
**/data/*.pt
**/data/*.mat

# All model theory/ folders are LOCAL-ONLY corpora: third-party copyrighted papers (publisher
# PDFs, author docs; the m7 corpus alone is ~700 MB), author-shared material and images,
# call/session transcripts (author privacy, incl. the author_convos/ convention
# <taskID or phaseID>_convo.<ext>), and reading notes on all of the above.
# Decision 2026-07-11 (supersedes the 2026-06-30 per-extension rule): NOTHING under any
# theory/ is published except the per-folder _CITATIONS.md manifests. Untracked going
# forward; files remain in pre-existing history (no rewrite).
# (First pattern ignores all contents; `!**/` re-includes directories so the manifest
# negation can reach into subfolders; only _CITATIONS.md files escape the ignore.)
openwave/xperiments/*/theory/**
!openwave/xperiments/*/theory/**/
!openwave/xperiments/*/theory/**/_CITATIONS.md

# Agent resume checkpoints (session-local in-flight state for any Mx model task or platform
# T task; not research artifacts, never tracked). Findings live in the tracked tasks/ + data/
# + plots/ instead.
openwave/xperiments/*/research/checkpoints/
dev_docs/checkpoints/

# Live-monitor IPC scratch file: written continuously while a run is on,
# read by the viewer process. Not an artifact.
openwave/xperiments/*/data/_live_monitor_data.json

# M4 K-sweep demo output (pipeline_engine/physics/_demo_k_sweep.py), regenerated on each run.
# The file only: m2 and m5 track files in their model-root data/ folders.
openwave/xperiments/m4_ewt/data/k_sweep_golden.json
